OPAQUE 1

This file exists on purpose. .qqq is not a real format, so it exercises the one branch of the
language table that can never be closed: the unknown bucket. A viewer that answers "what is this
project made of" has to say something honest about files it cannot name, and the only way to keep
testing that path is to keep a file that lands in it.

13 KB of padding follows so the bucket is visible on the map rather than a sliver.

